    <summary>A fast, native API client and test runner — an open-source Postman alternative</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# GoPost

A fast, native API client and test runner built with Go + Wails + React.

## Features

- **All HTTP methods** — GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, PATCH, HEAD, OPTIONS, GRAPHQL
- **GraphQL first-class support** — schema introspection, query editor, variables
- **`.http` file round-trip** — import/export compatible with VS Code REST Client
- **CLI runner** — `gopost run` with JUnit/JSON reporters for CI/CD
- **Git-friendly storage** — directory-per-collection, one-file-per-request
- **Environments** — variable substitution in URLs, headers, and body
- **Git integration** — built-in status, commit, push, pull

## CLI Quick Start

```cmd
gopost run my-collection --reporter junit --output results.xml
gopost run .\api.http --env production --parallel 4
gopost watch .\api.http
```
    ]]></description>
